<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunfire damaged a house in Culiacán that is reportedly linked to Sinaloa Governor Rocha Moya, wounding a man outside, while Mexican bishops are urging authorities to locate a missing priest in Sinaloa. In Florida, authorities dismantled a Sinaloa-linked cocaine pipeline that used commercial trucks to move cocaine into Tampa Bay, resulting in racketeering charges against multiple suspects. In Oklahoma City, an 18-year-old was arrested after shooting a 25-year-old veteran outside a bank, and another 18-year-old was arrested on murder and robbery complaints related to a separate bank shooting. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPTXpfWEhrYUpnc0xFX05JVVdOcDBsbWg2NTFjVkRVRFZEby0zYUR3ZmRIeHNpRy1HOVNzR2FRNVBXWDJwcm9uZlEweEJkZVN3dWduUFNGMmg5Z1doMDY3VG1GMEtsTUNNV3ladjhvT2RtaHloc1pRLXFsTVFXc2ZVLTZYUDViRXhzQm9hMlM1X0FvNE53ZEFocTZqZmRUclNrck1Uc0Z0X3gtd3dubXVZLXhCWm5nZnFCOEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Parriva&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxNcmw5anVkbFhYcWF2dmZxdlRqS3Z2SFV3dEFUTXVjd1cwVU5NaUxsMDFBUlpnTVhjR1lESjU5LWlJUUdGVEsxdHdCWGlHRlRHVGV0NUZ4dk1nU3hVZUFIU051dVlvQl9XM2NGWHJ4MG13SUlua0Z0Q29tbHhxRHN3dkRpZUNza0diVDhIbDVRQl9wcjlVRWdzTThGeFhXRW9tS0dPZ3VCZzgtVEQzZVhqdjl5N05WeC1IZzM2NnliVkdNS0JXeHgxT2FUMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Parriva&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WZTV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQaks5Um04c25NSE1CV2NmZ0JCVWxsVF9QQ1YxU3JxLWNZMDMxclYyQ3Bhb0pzdkw2X2lhaVNTYldHT2NheGplNlJpRDhSWXlFd1VscFJMVEdZTDNIQklocWdZcTVoX0NVMmdGWmFQNlU0VG0tRENsdy14LUlNV1lFaHg5M1VDdEdyTEFhZExiRU1nbnNWSW01R3BSNjNGUHZHelU2MzViTEVhejFkMHZobGswdmZMdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;KOKH&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxORTR0